### Tone: End-of-game award: Gut Feeling, the fastest to lock in on average. $seconds: their average seconds to lock in.
### Suspicious of the speed; mock the confidence, not the person.

award-gut-feeling-1 =
    The Gut Feeling award goes to { $name }: locked in after { $seconds ->
        [one] one second
       *[other] { $seconds } seconds
    } on average. Thinking, it seems, is optional.
award-gut-feeling-2 = { $name }, the fastest answers in the room. I’d call it instinct. The data calls it a hunch.
award-gut-feeling-3 =
    Gut Feeling: { $name }, averaging { $seconds ->
        [one] one second
       *[other] { $seconds } seconds
    } per answer. Other people were still reading the question.
award-gut-feeling-4 = { $name } locked in first, again and again. Confidence: maximum. Deliberation: under review.
award-gut-feeling-5 = The award for trusting your gut goes to { $name }. Your gut has been notified. It seemed unsurprised.
award-gut-feeling-6 = { $name }, quickest to commit to a number. Second thoughts were not on the menu.
award-gut-feeling-7 =
    { $seconds ->
        [one] One second,
       *[other] { $seconds } seconds,
    } on average, from question to lock-in. { $name }, did you read them first? Don’t answer. You’d answer too fast.
award-gut-feeling-8 = Gut Feeling: { $name }. Fast. Decisive. Occasionally right. A dangerous combination.
award-gut-feeling-9 = { $name } answers the way other people sneeze. Quickly, and without much planning.
award-gut-feeling-10 = The Gut Feeling goes to { $name }, who treats the timer as a suggestion to finish early.
award-gut-feeling-11 = { $name } locked in before I had finished reading the question aloud. Rude, but efficient.
award-gut-feeling-12 =
    Gut Feeling: { $name }, about { $seconds ->
        [one] one second
       *[other] { $seconds } seconds
    } per answer. Your gut works faster than most brains. Not better. Faster.
award-gut-feeling-13 = The Gut Feeling goes to { $name }. The calculator was available. You chose vibes.
award-gut-feeling-14 = { $name }, the first to commit, every round. I admire the speed. I audit the results.
award-gut-feeling-15 = Gut Feeling: { $name }. Think fast, they say. You skipped straight to the fast.
